 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Abelian varieties are projective",
 "statement": "Every abelian variety $A$ over\na field $k$ is projective over $k$; in particular $A$ carries\nan ample invertible $\\mathcal O_A$-module.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-abelian-varieties/sk-prop-av-projective/lem-sc-abelian-variety-projective.md",
